<title>USA: Pogo Producing ups proven reserves in 1996.</title>
<headline>Pogo Producing ups proven reserves in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pogo Producing Co said on Tuesday that its proven oil and natural gas reserves increased in 1996 to 658.6 billion cubic feet equivalent from 599.2 billion.</p>
<p>The total includes recently completed estimates of the firm's Thailand proven reserves: 361 billion cubic feet of natural gas and 49.6 billion barrels of crude oil.</p>
<p>Pogo also said its Thai subsidiary and partners have begun crude oil and natural gas production in the new Tantawan Field in the Gulf of Thailand.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
